{"channelId":"UCbeajb1Ofb33rlVuLk4DtAA","row":["Aiken Equine Rescue",81,"Aiken Equine Rescue is the Largest Equine Rescue in SC\nOur mission is to rescue unwanted horses who have suffered from abuse and neglect and to \"repurpose\" off-the-track thoroughbreds. \nThe Aiken Equine Rescue has placed over 800 horses, donkeys and mules since our founding in 2006. \nBy combining our efforts with community programs, donations and our ever-growing group of volunteers, we are able to provide each horse with food, medical attention and personal care until we find an appropriate and responsible placement.\nHope you enjoy our horse videos!\n- See more at: http://aikenequinerescue.org","aikenequinerescue@gmail.com; volunteer.aikenequinerescue@gmail.com","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbeajb1Ofb33rlVuLk4DtAA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbeajb1Ofb33rlVuLk4DtAA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:44.355Z"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://aikenequinerescue.org/","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:40:38.636Z","method":"self_published_jsonld_addressCountry","entityName":"Aiken Equine Rescue"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbeajb1Ofb33rlVuLk4DtAA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":81,"raw":"81 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbeajb1Ofb33rlVuLk4DtAA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:44.355Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"aikenequinerescue@gmail.com","purpose":"unknown","ownerRole":"unknown","identityStatus":"channel_published","sourceUrls":["https://aikenequinerescue.org/","https://aikenequinerescue.org/business-partners-1","https://aikenequinerescue.org/contact-us","https://aikenequinerescue.org/about","https://aikenequinerescue.org/home"],"evidenceIds":["public-page:0ac070ed490982a5c4c3a49c","public-page:e72d2dcdd9e2680cf34816fc","public-page:567be88081d6ecd56722272d","public-page:71c66014eeb771141bd73de4","public-page: